[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 10380.87, "timestamp": "02:53:00", "text": "还有一件事。我已经感觉就像……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10382.55, "timestamp": "02:53:02", "text": "你知道，灯已经开始亮了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10390.55, "timestamp": "02:53:10", "text": "是的。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10392.63, "timestamp": "02:53:12", "text": "对自己的领域很了解。我当时想，“好吧，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10397.75, "timestamp": "02:53:17", "text": "你当时就说，“你要去吗？”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10399.429, "timestamp": "02:53:19", "text": "做点什么之类的？”而我当时"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10401.03, "timestamp": "02:53:21", "text": "比如，“是啊，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10403.83, "timestamp": "02:53:23", "text": "他正在努力奋斗。他正在投入"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10405.67, "timestamp": "02:53:25", "text": "努力。太喜欢了。喜欢她的个性。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10407.269, "timestamp": "02:53:27", "text": "我喜欢一切。” 这就是我喜欢待在一起的原因。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10409.429, "timestamp": "02:53:29", "text": "在直播中，你知道的。啊，谢谢。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10412.469, "timestamp": "02:53:32", "text": "就像我知道的其他东西一样。是的。就像我看"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10416.71, "timestamp": "02:53:36", "text": "其他YouTube用户也是如此，但就像……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10418.63, "timestamp": "02:53:38", "text": "我不喜欢的性格方面的东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10420.79, "timestamp": "02:53:40", "text": "没关系。就像你一眼就能看出来一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10423.51, "timestamp": "02:53:43", "text": "一个人是在装病还是真心实意。是的。甚至"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10425.75, "timestamp": "02:53:45", "text": "如果你的屏幕上有图像，你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10427.67, "timestamp": "02:53:47", "text": "你知道，你可以从你的……中看出这一点"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10429.67, "timestamp": "02:53:49", "text": "嗓音"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10431.91, "timestamp": "02:53:51", "text": "你知道，谁在装模作样什么的。它是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10434.15, "timestamp": "02:53:54", "text": "就这么简单。我不知道。等等，该怎么做？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10436.55, "timestamp": "02:53:56", "text":